scontent-hkg4-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEC4xXV0MUGuASePod65h5gsjn-45LIelZFvLWpHmAq-Q&oe=6A91582F"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "239440537101368", "uri": "https://scontent-hkg1-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12410453_200768527038499_4161114219313364992_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=9wPAb0uQBTsQ7kNvwGvB2G1&_nc_oc=Adqf9XRL7cpxxayNFINdnxsrfx8ZarzYwe8GzyLMgfMulzxjJrSDkvOljjHhF38Obbs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-hkg1-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFnZrLxFcJvxvpmdp00vYdM_ofRcNgMh_AXjoL8rC91cg&oe=6A915A98"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Earth Origin", "keywords": ["Space", "Flight", "Combat", "Earth", "Battle"], "long_description": "Blast aliens, steer through winding tunnels, and explore the most dangerous corners of our solar system. This fast-paced space shooter puts you in the heat of the action, zipping past asteroids with enemies on your tail.\n\nShortly after our first contact with an alien species, a multitude of curious alien invaders from across the galaxy set course for our solar system, bringing with them war and destruction. As a new star in the Earth Alliance, your mission is to bring peace and safety back to our solar system, one planet at a time, starting at home: planet Earth.\n\nBegin with a few easy training missions and progress to harder campaigns, upgrading your ship with weapons and utilities along the way, and track your rank in the leaderboards. Each mission has a different goal, from protecting important structures and figuring out puzzles to destroying alien bosses.\n\nA swivel chair and gamepad are recommended but not required.\n\nVisit earthoriginvr.com/hints for help on completing missions.", "short_description": "Blast aliens, steer through winding tunnels, and explore the most dangerous corners of our solar system. This fast-paced space shooter puts you in the heat of the action, zipping past asteroids with enemies on your tail."}]}, "developer_name": n